      "summaries": {
        "en": "The Data Engineer Handbook is a comprehensive GitHub repository that serves as a curated guide for learning data engineering, addressing the challenge of navigating scattered resources. It organizes essential concepts, tools, and tutorials—covering Apache Spark, SQL, and big data—into a structured collection of Jupyter Notebooks and links. You can use it as a self-study roadmap, reference specific topics like data pipelines, or extend it by contributing practical examples to help others master real-world data workflows.",
        "zh": "《数据工程师手册》是一个GitHub上的开源项目，它通过系统化整理数据工程领域的学习资源，解决了初学者和从业者面对知识碎片化的难题。该项目以Jupyter Notebook为核心，将Apache Spark、SQL和大数据技术等关键内容链接成结构化指南，强调实践导向的学习路径。你可以将其作为自学路线图，参考其中的数据管道设计案例，或通过添加实际项目经验来扩展内容，从而快速掌握构建可靠数据系统的核心技能。",
        "es": "The Data Engineer Handbook is a comprehensive GitHub repository that serves as a curated guide for learning data engineering, addressing the challenge of navigating scattered resources. It organizes essential concepts, tools, and tutorials—covering Apache Spark, SQL, and big data—into a structured collection of Jupyter Notebooks and links. You can use it as a self-study roadmap, reference specific topics like data pipelines, or extend it by contributing practical examples to help others master real-world data workflows.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "data-engineer-handbook stands out for apachespark, awesome, and bigdata in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "The Data Engineer Handbook is a comprehensive GitHub repository that serves as a curated guide for learning data engineering, addressing the challenge of navigating scattered resources. It organizes essential concepts, tools, and tutorials—covering Apache Spark, SQL, and big data—into a structured collection of Jupyter Notebooks and links. You can use it as a self-study roadmap, reference specific topics like data pipelines, or extend it by contributing practical examples to help others master real-world data workflows.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/DataExpert-io/data-engineer-handbook for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
