      "summaries": {
        "en": "Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct is a compact instruction-tuned language model designed to deliver conversational AI capabilities on resource-constrained devices. It achieves efficiency through architectural optimizations that maintain strong reasoning abilities despite its small 1.5 billion parameter size. Developers can deploy it locally for privacy-sensitive applications, fine-tune it for specialized domains, or integrate it into edge computing systems where larger models are impractical.",
        "zh": "Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct是一款经过指令微调的小型语言模型，专门为资源受限环境提供对话式AI功能。它通过架构优化在仅15亿参数下保持了出色的推理能力，展示了如何在模型规模与性能间取得平衡。开发者可将其部署到本地设备实现隐私保护应用，针对特定领域进行微调，或集成到边缘计算系统中，为移动端和物联网场景提供智能对话支持。",
        "es": "Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct is a compact instruction-tuned language model designed to deliver conversational AI capabilities on resource-constrained devices. It achieves efficiency through architectural optimizations that maintain strong reasoning abilities despite its small 1.5 billion parameter size. Developers can deploy it locally for privacy-sensitive applications, fine-tune it for specialized domains, or integrate it into edge computing systems where larger models are impractical.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Qwen2-1.5B-Instruct stands out for transformers, safetensors, and qwen2 in real-world workflows.",
